## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | IMPORTANT | .github/workflows/build-mobile.yml | ⚠️ important the corrupt drop rule 1 mb cannot purge a complete but corupt partial — a poisoned tmp wasmrun xcframework zip re fails every nightly run on the self hosted box the cleanup only drops invalid zips smaller than 1 mb bash if unzip tq zip dev null 2 1 stat f z zip 2 dev null echo 0 lt 1000000 then rm f zip fi a zip that is complete but invalid size ≥ 1 mb — interleaved bytes from the shared tmp path an upstream tag re publish disk bit rot is never dropped every subsequent attempt does curl c against a full size file → the server answers http 416 the attempt fails unzip tq fails size ≥ 1 mb → kept all 10 attempts burn the step exits with the misleading could not be downloaded verified message and — because tmp persists on the fa m5 self hosted runner — the poisoned zip re fails every future nightly run until someone manually deletes the file the old code self healed here a fresh curl o truncated and re downloaded each run this is exactly the trap the sibling build macos yml gh 1759 loop already solved for the same asset github workflows build macos yml 485 535 keep vs purge check at 527 535 if the persisted zip is already complete and digest valid skip the download — a c attempt against a complete file gets http 416 and reads success as failure and its three way check got eq asset bytes digest → keep got lt asset bytes → keep partial for resume else → purge and restart suggested fix track the expected size build macos yml pins asset bytes 97238501 for this exact url and invert the drop rule — keep the partial only while it is incomplete size asset bytes purge it when the size reached exceeded the expected bytes but unzip tq or the pinned sha256 failed also name the persisted zip size in the error message so the on call knows to delete tmp wasmrun xcframework zip the pr description promises corrupt stubs … are dropped so the next attempt starts clean — this fix makes that true for all corrupt states not just 1 mb ones |
| F2 | open | IMPORTANT | .github/workflows/build-mobile.yml | ⚠️ important curl is missing fail — an http error body overwrites the accumulated partial and reads as success bash if curl l c retry 3 retry all errors retry delay 5 max time 300 o zip url unzip tq zip dev null 2 1 then without fail curl exits 0 on http 404 429 5xx and writes the error page into zip in this resume loop that is worse than a wasted attempt 1 the accumulated partial can be destroyed a transient error response mid resume replaces truncates the file that may hold 35–70 minutes of 22–45 kb s download — the exact progress this pr exists to preserve the next attempt then starts from near zero 2 http errors never engage the loop retry all errors retries within the curl invocation but a persistent 404 release re published moved just repeats 10 identical fast attempts instead of failing fast and the final error …could not be downloaded… never surfaces the http status — the on call cannot tell asset gone from link too slow the sibling gh 1759 loop in build macos yml uses c and fail with a comment stating this verbatim github workflows build macos yml 509 511 —fail without it curl exits 0 on http 404 5xx and writes the error page into the zip with it every http error engages this loop s retries suggested fix add fail to the curl invocation plain fail not fail with body — the body must not land in zip one token matches the established pattern and curl s stderr 22 the requested url returned error code then explains any persistent failure |
| F3 | open | SUGGESTION | .github/workflows/build-mobile.yml | 💡 suggestion pin the asset sha256 like build macos yml does — unzip tq proves integrity not authenticity bash url https github com juancastillo0 wasm run releases download wasm run v0 1 0 wasmrun xcframework zip unzip tq only validates zip crc32s this asset is a third party binary xcframework that gets code signed into the shipped ios app downloaded from an unpinned third party release url that could be re published with different content under the same tag the repo already treats this as a supply chain concern for the same url — build macos yml 485 487 the release asset is immutable per tag — pin its digest so a wrong content but valid zip cannot slip past unzip crc32 into the permanent wasmrun xcframework v0 1 0 cache with asset digest aca903d732202bcdf9c8d19fbb8a795c3c930762419f852a5ee228468c548a98 asset bytes 97238501 build macos yml 487 491 a one line shasum a 256 c after the loop plus the byte size check also gives you the complete vs incomplete distinction needed for the purge rule in the sibling ⚠️ thread — and it matches the repo s existing practice of pinning actions by sha e g actions cache 55cc83… elsewhere in this workflow optional hardening doesn t block merge |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

